Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Own commands.test after Claude, then push a green factory
 branch.

Claude's background shells die with `claude -p`, so the role runner now
keeps the checkout, runs or waits on the profile test command, and only
then pushes factory/* (never main/master). Red tests resume Claude in the
same workspace (max two) and are never pushed.
